# Copy to tools/tiktok/.env and fill in. NEVER commit the real file.
# Only needed for the optional API upload path — see §7 of
# 01-marketing/01-tiktok-content-system.md for why you probably shouldn't.
#
# From https://developers.tiktok.com → your app → Content Posting API,
# with the `video.upload` scope authorised by the SUNOI TikTok account.
TIKTOK_CLIENT_KEY=
TIKTOK_CLIENT_SECRET=
TIKTOK_REFRESH_TOKEN=
